# Checkpoint definition (specs/tools/checkpoints.md); tools/checkpoints/make.py
# builds the save with d2s-tool. Ids are rows of the 1.14d tables
# (levels, monstats, objects), as the traces/playthrough/act*.play
# comments name them. Gear and stats are our choice for the point.
# Duriel's Lair is level 73, Duriel monstats 211. Duriel's death leads to 14.4 (Tyrael) then Meshif msg 450 sets 14.0.
checkpoint 1
name CkDuriel
title Duriel: Duriel's Lair (Act II boss, quest 14)
class sor
level 30
expansion
difficulty normal
act 1
stat 0 45   # strength
stat 1 70   # energy
stat 2 35   # dexterity
stat 3 75   # vitality
stat 4 0     # unspent stat points
stat 5 0     # unspent skill points
stat 6 50944   # life 199 (x256)
stat 7 50944
stat 8 41728   # mana 163
stat 9 41728
stat 10 43008   # stamina 168
stat 11 43008
skill 0 4   # fb (skill 36)
skill 3 4   # ib (skill 39)
